    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk2-alternatives-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Ask or state a choice",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "还是 offers alternatives in a question. Use （是）…还是… for alternative clauses. 那 can introduce the next action following the preceding situation.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "你喝茶还是喝水？",
                "pinyin": "nǐ hē chá háishi hē shuǐ ？",
                "meaning": "Will you drink tea or water?",
                "audio": "4f7ec48136a9314211c48eeecee9b6cae4fec4c50e495804b1e09d69a77755d2"
              },
              {
                "text": "是你去还是我去？",
                "pinyin": "shì nǐ qù háishi wǒ qù ？",
                "meaning": "Are you going, or am I?",
                "audio": "ac289ce2f15497e7524204ccab4e1c7e1b74800368e4883a2bcd9e314ece483d"
              },
              {
                "text": "那我们走吧。",
                "pinyin": "nà wǒmen zǒu ba 。",
                "meaning": "Then let us go.",
                "audio": "a9af4e6bfe8f8801080052b7a0f0262be6d92df396f1c7eff06bc2a48427dc28"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "是",
                "pinyin": "shì",
                "meaning": "be",
                "singleWord": true,
